# Backend Rules

## Structure

- Thin controllers; business logic in domain/application services
- Repository interfaces; no raw provider SDKs in domain services
- Await all async work; no fire-and-forget for money/rights without outbox

## Money & rights

- Idempotency keys on order/payment/reward/entitlement grants
- Unique provider event IDs
- Integer minor currency units
- Transactions around fulfill + entitlement grant when possible

## Access

- All content bytes/playback go through Access Engine
- Return structured decision codes

## Errors

- Typed error codes; no silent catch
- Non-critical ports (analytics, AI, email) fail-open
